# =============================================================================
# Sholynk Tech — static host routing rules (Cloudflare Pages)
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Rules are evaluated top to bottom; the first match wins.
#
# What is deliberately NOT in this file:
#   * clean-URL rewrites (`/about  /about.html  200`). Pages serves /about from
#     about.html itself, and a `200` rewrite targeting a .html file fights that
#     handling and produces an infinite redirect loop (Cloudflare reports it as
#     "Infinite loop detected ... and has been ignored").
#   * anything under /articles/* — clean article URLs are server-rendered by
#     functions/articles/[slug].ts, and the legacy /article.html?slug=… links
#     are redirected by functions/article.ts.
# =============================================================================

# /admin is deliberately not listed: Pages serves it from admin/index.html
# itself (directory index handling), and a `/admin → /admin/` rule would match
# both paths on hosts that normalise trailing slashes — a redirect loop.
